  "description": "XAFDIR crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C20 H44 La3 Mo2 N7 O34,4(C4 H8 O1). From the CIF bond table, La1 (La) has 10 O neighbors; La2 (La) has 10 O neighbors; La3 (La) has 9 O neighbors; Mo1 (Mo) has 3 O neighbors; Mo2 (Mo) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 7 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 4.078-5.287 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 151.40-165.55°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C36H76N7O38La3Mo2. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 7 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
